System Modules

Authentication: Manages login, roles, and permissions for students, lecturers, and admins.

Course Management (Projects): Create and manage courses as JIRA projects with tasks/assignments.

Registration: Enroll students by adding users to course/projects with specific roles.

Reports: Dashboards and analytics to track progress and performance.


Main Classes/Entities

Student: Enrolls in courses, views assignments, tracks progress.

Course (Project): Holds assignments/tasks and enrolled students.

Lecturer: Creates and manages courses, posts assignments, views reports.

Admin: Manages users, roles, courses, and system settings.


Relationships

Student ↔ Course: Many-to-many (students join multiple courses; courses have many students).

Lecturer ↔ Course: One-to-many (one lecturer teaches many courses).

Admin ↔ All: One-to-many (admin oversees users and courses).

Course ↔ Reports: One-to-many (each course generates multiple reports)
